  "observations": "Inspected full numbered source and all three small-component sheets. Exclude border specks and explicit acute tips only. Preserve genuine small eye corners, lip slit, closed garment triangles and tiny enclosed lower-frame gap. Reconnect the child's two fragmented iris crescents and the corner of its upper eye-white band, while keeping outer eye whites distinct. Large figure's face neck and chest are continuous through open contours; child's face torso and arms are continuous, with a separate lower supporting hand and feet. Halo tiles, veil, collar beads and flowing garment bands retain their outlines. Names describe visible people/features without inferring identity from a number. Source/canonical ink and earlier packages remain unchanged.",
